# novadeck: enable the power-button LED on release. /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh image so
# systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the stock 99-default.preset is "disable *"; this
# higher-priority preset (60 < 99) keeps it enabled. A build-time multi-user.target.wants symlink
# ships alongside as a fallback (cf. 60-novadeck-powerbuttond.preset).
enable novadeck-power-led.service
